            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c) Contractual Agreement—A unit member on leave for teaching in a college or university shall agree to return to service in the Montgomery County Public Schools for at least a two-year period immediately following the leave of absence or reimburse the Board of Education for all monies paid to him/her or on his/her behalf.",
