        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e) Status on Return From Leave—A unit member who is on permanent status at the time leave for teaching in a college or university is granted shall continue in the permanent status he/she held at the time leave was granted.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
